    "description": "# napari-skopkit\n\nRun [scikit-ops](https://github.com/apposed/scikit-ops) ops from napari: pick\nan op, fill in its form, and the result comes back as a layer. Each op runs in\nits own environment, built the first time you use it.\n\nThis is an early development release, for early adopters. Things will change.\n\n```sh\npip install --pre napari-skopkit\n```\n\nThen open **Plugins \u25b8 scikit-ops \u25b8 Ops** in napari.\n\n- Source: https://github.com/apposed/napari-skopkit\n- Docs: https://scikit-ops.readthedocs.io\n",
